WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.770
Why do you cry?

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.610
Please stop.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.280
It makes it seem as though...

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.180
...I am arbitrarily bullying an underclassman.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.110
I am the one who wants to cry.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.180
Being avoided by my little sister,

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.710
never even being told why.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.860
Why will you not talk to me?

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.060
Is that just how little I mean to you?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.930
If that is how it is,
there is no purpose in being soeurs.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.610
Why did you even accept my rosary?

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.640
Enough already.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.010
Let us discuss this more calmly on another day.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.050
It seems I am slightly overwrought myself,

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.010
so I may have gone too far with what I said.

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:03.650
Oh!

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.720
What happened to Yumi-chan?

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.230
It's nothing.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.560
Let us begin our meeting
concerning tomorrow's game.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.370
It's nothing?

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:17.900
But...

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:24.370
Do you two intend to arbitrarily
make me the villain as well?

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:25.670
Sachiko...

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.450
It really is nothing.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:45.600
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.230
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:55.200
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.080
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.620
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.880
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.550
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:24.130
Maria Watches Over Us

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:46.920
Surprising Chocolate - Part II

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:52.430
Rosa chinensis...

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.460
So you're ever-flowering?

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:01.930
I wonder if my Onee-sama hates me now.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.970
Rosa Gigantea...

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:24.720
I considered that you might
want to be left alone, but...

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:34.460
Still, that was like a reenactment
of a scene from the past.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:35.330
What?

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:40.000
You and Sachiko are surprisingly
similar in some ways.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.870
The way you and Sachiko were earlier...

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.150
That was exactly how it went
one year and ten months ago...

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:50.170
...between Sachiko and Yoko,
the current Rosa Chinensis.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.090
Partly due to the environment she was raised in,

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.460
Sachiko wasn't good at clearly
expressing her own thoughts,

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.020
so she would often be silently
indignant about something or other.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.530
Sachiko-sama would?

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.130
But one day,

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:08.070
Yoko sternly told her that behaving
that way told her nothing.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.870
That if she had something to say
that she should say it clearly.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.440
Why have you grown silent?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:18.770
Why won't you confront me
with the words in your heart?

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.410
I can't know anything if you're like this!

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:28.080
It seems Sachiko responded
to Yoko's stern words.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:32.420
Since then, she gradually grew to
be able to express her thoughts.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:37.430
Well, that's probably why Sachiko
gets so irritated with you.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.370
Irritated? Sachiko-sama?

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.100
Right.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.160
Why?

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.760
Because it's like she's seeing herself, of course.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:51.470
Deep inside, Sachiko hasn't really changed.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.540
Probably not even now.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.050
That's why she feels irritated.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:03.420
Because she sees in you a part
of herself that she dislikes.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.250
So I hope you'll forgive Sachiko.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.930
There's hardly anything to forgive...

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.970
Then, you won't grow to hate
Sachiko over something like this?

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.070
Good girl.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.600
Then, let's go.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.940
This greenhouse isn't exactly
a favorite place of mine.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.550
What will I do?

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.480
Soon, you will be graduating.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.720
What will I do then?

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.790
There's no one else who will help me like this.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:45.130
I'm flattered you'd say that.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:48.660
It'll work out somehow.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:53.240
If you can express your true
feelings to Sachiko a little more...

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.480
As long as you become able to do that,

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.670
I'm sure you'll be able to overcome
whatever else may happen.

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:00.980
But...

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.850
All right, I'll assign you some homework.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:07.350
Reconcile with Sachiko on your own. Got it?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.090
Yes.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:15.590
What?! You're not going
to give me any chocolates?!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:20.090
Why don't you just tell Shimako-san
that you want chocolates?

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.230
No way.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.500
Then, you have no choice but to give up on it.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:25.600
No way, no way.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:29.000
If you don't give me chocolates,
I'll eat you, Yumi-chan!

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.440
These will be for Sachiko-sama.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.550
The ones I messed up...

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.990
...will be punishment for
the flirtatious Rosa Gigantea.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.920
Tomorrow is Valentine's Day.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:50.330
Treasure Hunt Competition
Headquarters
for
Yamayuri Council Officers
Rosebuds

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:55.230
First, I have to apologize for yesterday.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.600
And then, I'll ask Sachiko-sama
for a moment of her time...

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.840
You scared me! So it was you, Yumi-san.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.430
Shimako-san, is Sachiko-sama here?

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.220
Y-Yes, upstairs.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.120
B-Bye now.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:25.630
I wonder what that was about.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:32.300
Oh, maybe this is where she hid her card.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.580
Give it up already, Yoshino.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:40.700
You don't have to tell me where you hid the card,

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.780
so just listen to my guesses!

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.950
Oh, you came at the perfect time.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:51.160
I'm sorry, but would you take this
annoying girl somewhere else for me?

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.380
Oh, okay...

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.720
You're a cheapskate, Onee-sama!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:58.950
Nevermind!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.600
Yumi-san, let's go.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.400
Yoshino-san, wait a minute.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:07.900
Onee-sama?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.240
What is it?

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:13.340
Um, pardon me about yesterday.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:18.580
And if you are available, I would
like a little of your time today.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.110
To continue what we started yesterday?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.520
All right.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.120
Would it be fine if we meet after
the treasure hunt is over?

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.190
Then, I shall be waiting
for you in the greenhouse.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.290
The greenhouse...

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.900
All right, then. In the greenhouse.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.910
I appreciate that so many of
you have come to participate.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.070
I will now explain how the game is to be played.

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:47.200
These are the cards you will be searching for.

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:52.120
There will be one each of these red,
yellow, and white cards...

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:54.450
...hidden somewhere on the school grounds.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.550
The time limit is one hour.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:58.230
If you find a card,

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.520
please bring it to the Rose Mansion
where we are headquartered.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.770
You will be presented on the
spot with the additional prize,

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.530
a ticket for a date for half a day with a bouton.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.760
T-They're so popular...

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.080
Y-Yes...

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:17.510
Now, I would like the soeurs of
the boutons to step forward.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.910
In order to ensure fairness,

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:23.440
the soeurs of the boutons
will start with a 5 minute delay.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.040
What?! No way!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.720
And now... Start!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.850
Maria Watches Over Us

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.030
The boutons can wait here
until the game is over.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.730
I didn't expect that even you would
participate, Rosa Foetida.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:47.900
I would never let such a fun event pass me by.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:53.140
Onee-sama, I will find the red card, without fail.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.410
Then, I guess I'll go drum up some interest.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:59.410
Hey! If you'd like,
why don't you come in for a chat?

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:01.850
The boutons are in here.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.080
Rosa Gigantea...

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.830
Are you not interested in
finding Shimako-san's card?

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.120
Shimako's card. You say it so simply, but...

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.230
Besides, I haven't the faintest idea
where she might have hid it.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:18.770
Aw, Shimako-san's card is probably in there...

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:24.500
Could it be that there's something
nice hidden in that room?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.040
Shoot!

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.310
All right, 5 minutes have passed.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.410
Ladies, you can start as well.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.980
Thanks. I wish you good luck!

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:38.390
Oh...

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:40.760
Yumi-san, let's go.

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.020
R-Right.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.060
Lucky Shimako-san.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.230
A date with the Rosa Gigantea, huh?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:59.510
Sachiko-sama is not in any
clubs nor on any committees.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.270
In which case...

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.920
Would it have to be the Rose Mansion?

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.350
W-What is this?

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:17.160
What?! Could they be fans of Sachiko-sama's?!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.900
They must think that I'll know where the card is.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:43.490
Oh, I don't have time to be
playing cat and mouse like this.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:46.650
Oh, there's only 15 minutes left!

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.900
I wonder where Sachiko-sama's red card is...

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:55.160
If I were to hide it...

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:57.990
If it were me...

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.580
If it were me, I would definitely hide it there!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:11.980
Oh!

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:18.390
Good day. I'm sorry. It seems I startled you.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:19.690
Oh, no...

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.360
Have you come here looking for the card, too?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.560
Yes...

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.240
This person was here before me...

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:34.400
But it seems she hasn't found the card yet.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:40.240
Just as I thought...

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:47.980
Um...

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:51.160
Oh, I think the card is probably here, so...

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:53.050
If you'd like, here...

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.190
Thank you.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.100
But it wasn't there.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:56.530
What?

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.300
I'm sorry for not saying so before.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.400
The truth is, I tried digging
in that spot just earlier.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.330
It can't be...

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:08.110
Why did you think the card would be there?

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.410
Why?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:16.280
Because this rose is the Rosa chinensis...

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.550
It is now 4:40.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:22.060
Those of you participating in the game,

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.290
please gather in the inner courtyard right away.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.090
And now, I will announce the results of the game.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.790
Two of the boutons' cards were found.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:39.640
Oh! I failed!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.570
All because Rei-chan wouldn't
give me any hints...

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.910
I wasn't able to find it, either.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:50.710
And I was so sure my Onee-sama's
card would be there.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:55.480
Now, first, the person who
found the white card.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.180
Year 2, Wisteria Class, Kanina Shizuka-san.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:58.980
What?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.020
Oh-ho, so Shizuka found it, huh?

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:10.470
After I gave her the hint with my
funny faces! What was she doing?!

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:12.660
Where did you find the white card?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.570
The student committee board.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:16.940
What?

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:19.310
It wasn't the first floor of the Rose Mansion?

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:22.810
Then, why did Shimako-san
behave like that when I saw her?

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.310
Next, the person who found the yellow card...

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:29.350
...was Year 1, Chrysanthemum Class,
Tanuma Chisato-san.

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:32.860
I found it in the library.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.730
But I searched the library, too!

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:37.260
And so,

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:43.160
no one was able to find Rosa
Chinensis en bouton's red card.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:45.760
No one?

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:50.280
Rosa Chinensis en bouton,
just where did you hide the red card?

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.040
Let's go retrieve it now.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.780
Uh, um, Onee-sama...

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.850
I came here, to this place.

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:08.450
But I was unable to find it.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.960
Where did you look?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.470
Near the base of the Rosa chinensis.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.200
Surely not...

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:19.400
Did you really look here?

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:20.370
Yes.

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:27.750
It can't be!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.420
I dug in the same spot!

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:32.520
Yumi-san, I'm very sorry, but...

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:33.920
I am not lying!

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:35.250
I even have a witness.

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.050
Who?

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:37.550
I-It was...

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:39.760
...someone I do not know.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:42.800
Then she won't be able to serve as a witness.

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.920
But I really...

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.030
I believe you.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.260
You speak with such certainty.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.160
Then, it really must not have been there earlier.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:56.230
Onee-sama...

00:16:57.310 --> 00:17:02.150
Besides, this card was buried
deeper than where I had buried it.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:02.810
What?

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:05.510
Which means...

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.680
St. Valentinus has been up to some mischief.

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:13.930
Perhaps we should just leave it at that?

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:19.700
If that is your wish, Rosa Chinensis en bouton.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:26.730
Onee-sama?

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:32.270
Um, would you please wait
for me at the Rose Mansion?

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:52.020
Shimako-san, what's wrong?

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:54.960
Wow, Yumi-chan!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.690
I've been waiting for you to
thank you for the chocolate.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:17:59.860
Yes, yes.

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:02.370
Here are your chocolates.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.380
Even though they're really bad tasting truffles.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:06.510
What?

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:12.980
Which means, the chocolate
in there wasn't yours?

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:13.710
What?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:16.590
What'll I do? I ate it.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.130
Because you were looking
so intently at that door,

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.190
I totally thought...

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.690
It was a really delicious marble cake.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:28.800
Though, the inexperience showed
and it was a bit lopsided.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:30.000
Um...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.700
Was it pink?

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:36.240
Yes, pink wrapping paper
with white rose patterns.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.480
In the back of the room on the first floor...

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.620
...was not the white card,

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:48.020
but Shimako-san's chocolate
cake that she had left there,

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.390
still undecided about whether to
give it to Rosa Gigantea or not.

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:55.930
Perhaps this was another act
of mischief by St. Valentinus.

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.130
Pardon me for making you wait.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:08.410
Onee-sama, there is something
I would like for you to have.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.740
I hope you don't mean the rosary.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.440
The rosary?!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.010
Apparently not. I'm glad.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.280
When I was a first-year student,

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:24.590
I felt as though my Onee-sama
could read my every thought.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:30.660
And yet, I do not really
understand what you are thinking.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.100
That must be why I had been feeling discouraged.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:39.140
And it seemed as though you were avoiding me,

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:40.800
so I was a little panicked.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.940
But that was my misunderstanding, wasn't it?

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:49.050
Um, it was because I wanted
to give these to you.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:53.180
I sought Rei-sama's advice and made these.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.150
I wanted to keep it a secret from you,

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:58.050
which is why I ended up sneaking around.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:01.590
I had gotten worked up and
carried away all by myself,

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:05.760
and I had no time left to consider
how it might come across to you.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:06.800
Yumi...

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:11.970
I know that you hate
Valentine's Day chocolates.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:17.380
But I desperately wanted to express my daily
gratitude to you in a tangible form, so I...

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:18.040
Yumi!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.380
Did I ever say that I hated them?

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:28.360
The target of my disgust was a
segment of the student population,

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.220
who attempt to satisfy their need...

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:32.690
...to give someone chocolates
on Valentine's Day.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.200
If it's something you made for me,

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.130
I would accept it most gratefully, of course.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.260
May I have it?

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:47.460
Oh...

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:48.930
N-No!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.110
As I said, it is not that I dislike chocolates...

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:51.480
You can't have this!
As I said, it is not that I dislike chocolates...

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.600
You can't have this!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:54.980
Uh, um, please take this one!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.420
Sachiko-sama, please let go!

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:59.250
Yumi, that is enough...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.580
Sachiko-sama!

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:16.700
Is this... some sort of performance?

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:17.670
Y-Yes.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.700
I-It's called surprising chocolate.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:23.680
There are horrible tasting ones mixed in...

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.270
...that will make you grimace,

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:27.270
and that is the surprise...

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:28.970
Here is another one.

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:31.540
Oh!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.390
It's delicious.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:40.890
Thank goodness.

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:42.630
Then, that was a good one.

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:47.120
Though both a good and a bad
one were missing in the end,

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:50.430
the one Sachiko-sama ate was a good one.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.730
Maybe this was also St. Valentinus...

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:59.270
Does something nice happen if
you happen to pick a good one?

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:03.450
Yes, every good one you draw...

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:07.820
...comes with a ticket to go on
a date for half a day with me.

